<title>ESTONIA: PORT OF TALLINN TO ISSUE 50 MLN KROONS OF CPS.</title>
<headline>PORT OF TALLINN TO ISSUE 50 MLN KROONS OF CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Port of Tallinn will issue commerical papers with a term of three months on July 13, Hansapank, who will handle the issue, said on Friday.</p>
<p>The commercial papers will have a yield of 7.5 percent and will be worth 50 million kroons, Ulo Kallas, Hansapank interest products manager, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
